.TH batten-enforce 1  "batten 0.0.61" 
.SH NAME
batten\-enforce \- Run every configured rule, including kinds that execute a configured command
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten enforce\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run every configured rule, including kinds that execute a configured command
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.0.61
